 due to or the blessings in his  life were due to people  giving him  care and attention  just perfect strangers who who just one  even taught him how to read which  enabled him to go on and to read for  parts it's an amazing story story sidney  poitier in his own words it airs  tomorrow night at nine eastern on b-e-t  an immediate thought immediately  following to sir with love beginning at  9 30. we'll be right back

